<FamilyFrame title="Home" description="A personal calendar and task dashboard for Vic's family picture frame.">
  <p class="eyebrow">A personal project</p>
  <h1>Family Frame Dashboard</h1>
  <p class="intro">A calendar, weather, and task display running on a picture frame in our home.</p>
  <p>The frame gets its dashboard from a Mac mini on our home network. Its Vic, Holly, and Both views show upcoming events from Google Calendars that the signed-in account can access. The Google connection is read-only: the dashboard cannot create, edit, or delete calendar events.</p>
  <p>Tasks are saved on the frame. Weather comes from Open-Meteo. This is a private household display, with no public sign-up or hosted copy of our calendar.</p>
  <p>For details about how calendar data is handled, see the <a href="/family-frame/privacy/">privacy policy</a>. You can also read the <a href="/family-frame/terms/">terms</a>.</p>
</FamilyFrame>
